brief:
	Newly infected. He only wants to show off his "super computer": "I just removed all the unnecessary parts and this time I succeeded!" Opened, it has no parts and runs anyway, on Cambion. He leaves it with the player: "Keep it until you have time to take a closer look! I'll be back for it later!"

